{"type":"standard","title":"Aaron Bean","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Aaron Bean</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q4661833","titles":{"canonical":"Aaron_Bean","normalized":"Aaron Bean","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Aaron Bean</span></span>"},"pageid":30869022,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Rep._Aaron_Bean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Aaron_Bean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Rep._Aaron_Bean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374017960","tid":"ebcfd4cc-ac2c-11f1-8410-d94c455f7639","timestamp":"2026-09-09T09:00:36Z","description":"American politician (born 1967)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Bean","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Bean?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Bean?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Aaron_Bean"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Bean","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Aaron_Bean","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Bean?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Aaron_Bean"}},"extract":"Aaron Paul Bean is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 4th congressional district since 2023. A Republican, Bean represented the 4th district in the Florida Senate, which included all of Nassau County, Clay County and parts of Duval County, from 2012 to 2022. From 2000 to 2008, he represented the 12th district in the Florida House of Representatives.","extract_html":"<p><b>Aaron Paul Bean</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 4th congressional district since 2023. A Republican, Bean represented the 4th district in the Florida Senate, which included all of Nassau County, Clay County and parts of Duval County, from 2012 to 2022. From 2000 to 2008, he represented the 12th district in the Florida House of Representatives.</p>"}